{"id":"9ea096c1bbc6888d","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-prop-strict.md","title":"Strictly Increasing Function","display":"prop-strict — Strictly Increasing Function","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-strict","aliases":["58-prop-strict"],"display":"prop-strict — Strictly Increasing Function","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-strict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-strict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-strict — Strictly Increasing Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(f,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> (function and ordinal parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrictlyIncreasing}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{StrictlyIncreasing}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (strict-increase predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}strict} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{StrictlyIncreasing}_S(f;\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)\\in f(\\beta))\n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}strict} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{StrictlyIncreasing}_S(f;\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)\\in f(\\beta))\n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For ordinal domains and codomains, membership is their strict order, so the displayed condition is the typed order-preservation law.</li>\n<li>The typing guards are part of the predicate definition itself, rather than an external implication that left the predicate unconstrained on ill-typed inputs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StrictlyIncreasing}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}strict} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{StrictlyIncreasing}_S(f;\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)\\in f(\\beta))\n.","display":true}],"bytes":1309,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3997","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-prop-strict.md|58-prop-strict]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}